      "description": "Whose phone is this — and what are they hiding?\n\nLeaked is a realistic detective game built around one fictional phone. Snoop through the messages, hidden photos, deleted chats, social feeds, and locked apps to uncover the lies, the secrets, and the affair someone tried to bury. Every case is an investigation into a relationship that isn't what it seems.\n\nHOW YOU PLAY\n- Read the texts. Scroll the feeds. Dig through notes, galleries, calendars, and locked albums.\n- Follow the trail of suspicious messages and deleted evidence.\n- Catch the lie, expose the truth, and close the case before the story slips away.\n\nNothing on the phone is random. Any contact, any app, any photo can hold the detail that cracks the case. No hints, no hand-holding — just you, the phone, and the secret hiding in plain sight.\n\nThe phones are fiction — every case is bundled story content, never your real device or your own data. You play a detective inside a story; you are not accessing anyone's real information.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://inshort.io/stalkie-privacy\nTerms of Use (EULA): https://inshort.io/stalkie-terms",
